From 5c3ae8e5068b5da21d2c37f9545c0f7b10eba147 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:46:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(storage): support owned symbolic link operations

Use the existing component walker for owned symlink traversal, link
metadata and target bytes. Preserve final namespace entries during
mutation, independent descriptor positions and pinned/whiteout identity.
Join configured symlink calls and keep owned traversal within assigned
storage until image/owned traversal is supported.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
---
